    "sections": {
        "description": "Novyra is a modern multipurpose theme designed for agencies, studios, and businesses that require flexibility without sacrificing structure. Built with full site editing FSE support, Novyra provides complete control over layouts, typography, and content organization, enabling consistent and adaptable digital experiences. Its dark and refined aesthetic combined with a modular design system makes it suitable for corporate websites, creative portfolios, and agency projects, offering a reliable foundation focused on clarity, performance, and long term scalability."
